!!! oculus/window-role.mat
!!! Semantic roles for scene nodes.
!!!
!!! Each role describes what a node is in the scene, not what it looks like.
!!! Roles are the basis for accessibility and machine projections.

book oculus.window.role

read everything from ny.lang.core

public window-role begin choice
    when Desktop
    when Region
    when Control
    when Heading
    when Status
    when Panel
end choice
